00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:22.103
And so if we need the philosophy side,

00:09:22.103 --> 00:09:23.354
what it practically means
is we're trying to install

00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:27.733
at least kill different
online services we've built up

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:28.859
by adding more automation,

00:09:28.859 --> 00:09:31.779
adding more sort of data
integration a bit more small data

00:09:31.779 --> 00:09:32.822
analytics and stuff like that.

00:09:32.822 --> 00:09:34.782
One of the first approaches on that

00:09:34.782 --> 00:09:36.826
