00:09:40.204 --> 00:09:42.498
We are building it up for companies that,

00:09:42.498 --> 00:09:45.126
if companies will consent and agree,

00:09:45.126 --> 00:09:47.878
the government have access
to the financial records,

00:09:47.878 --> 00:09:50.089
the same data that is digital anyways,

00:09:50.089 --> 00:09:52.592
then we won't ever bother
them with a report,

00:09:52.592 --> 00:09:55.219
not for tax, not for
employment, not for statistics

00:09:55.219 --> 00:09:57.138
not for annual reports so forth.

00:09:57.138 --> 00:10:00.391
All these things the
companies can now do online,

00:10:00.391 --> 00:10:02.226
why do we bother them with an extra step?

00:10:02.226 --> 00:10:03.728
If you have the data it's done

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.535
- There are definitely
outliers and there's definitely

00:10:19.535 --> 00:10:22.371
