00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.420
- The fourth industrial
revolution is a reality

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.921
within it.

00:11:53.921 --> 00:11:54.755
And I would say it's very important

00:11:54.755 --> 00:11:57.550
that the rate of change on
the inside be at least equal

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:00.553
