00:12:10.062 --> 00:12:12.106
more affordable and more simple to use.

00:12:12.106 --> 00:12:15.526
It's now on us, our generation
of leaders to make sure

00:12:16.902 --> 00:12:19.530
that we turn this into the
opportunity that it actually is,

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.531
and to make sure that we can drive

00:12:20.531 --> 00:12:23.534
sustainable economic
growth, employment creation,

00:12:23.534 --> 00:12:26.495
job creation and we can
drive a better integration

00:12:26.495 --> 00:12:27.955
of our societies in the world.

