00:12:42.303 --> 00:12:45.514
- Over the past, maybe
five to eight years,

00:12:45.514 --> 00:12:48.934
customers are no longer
willing to tolerate delays

00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:53.063
or lack of transparency or not
