00:12:53.063 --> 00:12:54.774
or being mistreated for that matter.

00:12:54.774 --> 00:12:57.568
Historically, the economy
was more like product driven

00:12:57.568 --> 00:13:00.613
in the seventies, and then
you get into the eighties

00:13:01.614 --> 00:13:02.448
and the nineties, and now it's more moving

00:13:02.448 --> 00:13:04.283
towards like a relationship economy.

00:13:04.283 --> 00:13:05.868
- We live in the experience economy,

00:13:05.868 --> 00:13:08.287
and I think this is something
that you would see more

00:13:08.287 --> 00:13:09.371
and more and more.

00:13:09.371 --> 00:13:11.916
When you think about the effort
that we're putting together

00:13:11.916 --> 00:13:13.793
across the board, private
sector, public sector

00:13:13.793 --> 00:13:17.421
and how we all try to put
everything that on the customer

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:19.507
make sure that the customer
is actually the epicenter.

00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:22.426
And how can we actually,
from a government standpoint

00:13:23.385 --> 00:13:25.012
contribute to that quality of life,

00:13:25.012 --> 00:13:27.473
contribute to that will be,
take away all the uncertainties

00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:30.810
that come with it and give
them the ability to focus on

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.020
what they would like to focus on,

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.064
what they love most and
what they like best,

00:13:35.064 --> 00:13:38.359
which is a service that's
one curated around them,

00:13:38.359 --> 00:13:40.152
two, that it's there when they need it.

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:41.779
And actually think about what does

00:13:41.779 --> 00:13:43.739
the customer slash citizen need

00:13:43.739 --> 00:13:45.658
and not what does the government need.

00:13:45.658 --> 00:13:47.743
For very long time
governments have been focused

00:13:47.743 --> 00:13:51.580
on actually designing
services or that implementing

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:54.917
those designs in a way
that suits the governments

00:13:54.917 --> 00:13:56.710
from different perspectives.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.295
And I think what you're
seeing here is actually

00:13:58.295 --> 00:13:59.213
a total diverse.

